EN:
{{TAG:000D:0004:03CD}}{{TAG:0003:000C:}}If you're trying to cheer me up, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}it's
not working.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} I just need a little bit
of alone time.{{TAG:000D:0005:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000D:0004:03CD}}{{TAG:0003:000C:}}So che vuoi tirarmi su il morale,
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}ma adesso non funziona.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} Ho solo
